@startuml

autonumber
skinparam actorStyle awesome
title "Manage Own Subscriptions and Notifications"

actor User

participant "UI" as ui
participant "Subscription API" as api
participant "Acumatica ERP Auth" as auth
database "Subscription DB" as db

== Authentication & Authorization (applies to all requests) ==

note over api
Each request requires:
- session validation
- identity resolution (user_id)
- access scope restriction (user can access only own data)
- optional role check (USER) for symmetry with admin flow
end note

== View subscriptions ==

User -> ui : Opens personal subscription settings
ui -> api : GET subscriptions/templates

api -> auth : Validate session / resolve user_id
auth --> api : identity confirmed

api -> db : Load subscriptions by user_id
db --> api : Return user subscriptions + templates

api --> ui : Display personal subscriptions

== Update subscription preferences ==

User -> ui : Update notification preferences
ui -> api : POST/PUT subscription changes

api -> auth : Validate session / resolve user_id
auth --> api : identity confirmed

api -> db : Update subscriptions for user_id scope
db --> api : Confirm update

api --> ui : Success response

@enduml